{"publicId":"33bf913d-1fd4-4c47-97b8-d7e3c7a3ca15","title":"FIU团队开发AI工具可识别手机照片中的蚊卵，实验室准确率88.3%","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T23:00:06.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T23:00:06.000Z","digest":"佛罗里达国际大学（FIU）研究团队开发了AI工具AeEggCounter，通过分析手机拍摄的168张实验室样本（含4398个人工标注蚊卵），在首次测试中实现88.3%的误报率和91.7%的漏检率修正值。后续在76份实地样本中，AI计数与专业人员人工统计的相关系数达0.82（论文发表于《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》）。该工具通过智能手机摄像头实现蚊卵识别，实验室环境下可检测到直径约0.5毫米的卵体，但实地应用中光照、背景干扰等因素导致准确率下降约3.5个百分点。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T01:24:23.897Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"某研究团队在《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》发表AI工具检测蚊卵的论文","latestReport":{"id":"uwpo9g327ml7k2idfce5vgcd3"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fCbm0fcL2-TY","title":"开发AI工具用于智能手机照片中的蚊卵计数","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T23:00:06.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"uwpo9g327ml7k2idfce5vgcd3","title":"某研究团队在《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》发表AI工具检测蚊卵的论文","summary":"某研究团队在《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》发表AI工具检测蚊卵的论文，该工具基于YOLO算法，在实验室和实地样本中分别达到88.3%和91.7%的检测准确率，为蚊媒防控提供高效新方法。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T23:00:06.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"uwpo9g327ml7k2idfce5vgcd3","title":"某研究团队在《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》发表AI工具检测蚊卵的论文","summary":"某研究团队在《Journal of the American Mosquito Control Association》发表AI工具检测蚊卵的论文，该工具基于YOLO算法，在实验室和实地样本中分别达到88.3%和91.7%的检测准确率，为蚊媒防控提供高效新方法。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T23:00:06.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8